Package: openvpn-manager
Version: 1.7.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OpenVPN Manager <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: 140
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), python3-flask, gunicorn, python3-pam, python3-maxminddb, stunnel4, openvpn
Recommends: lighttpd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Web GUI for managing OpenVPN clients (Debian 11/12/13)
 A Flask-based HTTPS web interface (port 12322) for creating,
 revoking, renewing and downloading OpenVPN client certificates.
 .
 Compatible with TurnKey Linux OpenVPN on Debian 11 (Bullseye),
 Debian 12 (Bookworm) and Debian 13 (Trixie).
 .
 Features: PAM authentication, CSRF protection, brute-force
 lockout, security headers, session timeout, audit logging.
